data_fes2
# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [fes2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Cubic pyrite FeS2, Pa-3 (#205, origin choice 2): Fe occupies 4a at
# inversion centers and S occupies 8c at (x,x,x)-type positions with
# x=0.386. a=5.4166 A per Finklea, Cathey, and Amma, Acta Crystallogr. A32,
# 529 (1976). Assumes a stoichiometric, unmodulated room-temperature cell.
# Limiting checks: four Fe + eight S, V=a^3, S-S dimer bond ~2.14 A and
# Fe-S octahedral bond ~2.27 A from the idealized x. Validation: fes2-pyrite-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
